{"about_the_game":"Travel through diverse star systems, collect illegal cargo, and deliver it through dangerous zones \u2014 all while being chased by space cops. In Rogue Run, every delivery is a race against time and the law.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/extras/gif1.gif?t=1747229013\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\ude80 Deliveries Above All</h2>The goal is simple: <strong>complete at least 100 smuggling deliveries in under 15 minutes</strong>. Survive and the <strong>Operations Base will rescue you</strong> \u2014 with your loot.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/extras/gif4.gif?t=1747229013\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\udde0 Tactical Combat</h2>Instead of relying solely on weapons, <strong>use the environment and enemy tactics against them</strong>. <strong>Let them destroy each other</strong>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd27 Sideral Workshop</h2>Choose from <strong>dozens of upgrades</strong> that make each run unique. <strong>Enhance your ship</strong> via the <strong>roaming workshop of the mysterious Mr. Black</strong>.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/extras/gif3.gif?t=1747229013\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udef8 Ship Variety</h2>Unlock and upgrade ships, each with <strong>unique stats and skills</strong> to match <strong>different playstyles</strong>.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/extras/gif2.gif?t=1747229013\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u26a0\ufe0f Dynamic Wanted Level</h2>The more you deliver, <strong>the higher your wanted level</strong> \u2014 bringing <strong>faster, heavier, and deadlier foes</strong>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfc6 Score &amp; Leaderboards</h2>Compete indirectly with others via <strong>arcade-style rankings</strong>. <strong>More deliveries means more bragging rights</strong>.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/extras/gif5.gif?t=1747229013\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf0c Random Cosmic Events</h2><strong>Black holes, solar storms, nebulae</strong> and more appear randomly, <strong>directly impacting gameplay</strong>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udc2d The \u201cRat Trap\u201d Base</h2><strong>Expand and customize your base</strong>, unlocking <strong>global upgrades and new gear</strong> for future runs.<br><br><strong>Get ready</strong> for a <strong>space challenge</strong> where <strong>strategy, reflexes, and risk management</strong> are key to becoming the <strong>galaxy\u2019s most notorious smuggler</strong>.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/extras/gif6.gif?t=1747229013\" />","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3292110?t=1747229013","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/e333819b71e75b715102a6fc64364c2465bbbde6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747229013","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/213aa0fd2c7952bee03e76432047154210275278/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747229013","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/213aa0fd2c7952bee03e76432047154210275278/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747229013","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"May contain scenes of violence, inappropriate language, and use of legal drugs.\r\n\r\n"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"Travel through diverse star systems, collect illegal cargo, and deliver it through dangerous zones \u2014 all while being chased by space cops. In Rogue Run, every delivery is a race against time and the law.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/extras/gif1.gif?t=1747229013\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\ude80 Deliveries Above All</h2>The goal is simple: <strong>complete at least 100 smuggling deliveries in under 15 minutes</strong>. Survive and the <strong>Operations Base will rescue you</strong> \u2014 with your loot.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/extras/gif4.gif?t=1747229013\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\udde0 Tactical Combat</h2>Instead of relying solely on weapons, <strong>use the environment and enemy tactics against them</strong>. <strong>Let them destroy each other</strong>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd27 Sideral Workshop</h2>Choose from <strong>dozens of upgrades</strong> that make each run unique. <strong>Enhance your ship</strong> via the <strong>roaming workshop of the mysterious Mr. Black</strong>.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/extras/gif3.gif?t=1747229013\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udef8 Ship Variety</h2>Unlock and upgrade ships, each with <strong>unique stats and skills</strong> to match <strong>different playstyles</strong>.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/extras/gif2.gif?t=1747229013\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u26a0\ufe0f Dynamic Wanted Level</h2>The more you deliver, <strong>the higher your wanted level</strong> \u2014 bringing <strong>faster, heavier, and deadlier foes</strong>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfc6 Score &amp; Leaderboards</h2>Compete indirectly with others via <strong>arcade-style rankings</strong>. <strong>More deliveries means more bragging rights</strong>.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/extras/gif5.gif?t=1747229013\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf0c Random Cosmic Events</h2><strong>Black holes, solar storms, nebulae</strong> and more appear randomly, <strong>directly impacting gameplay</strong>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udc2d The \u201cRat Trap\u201d Base</h2><strong>Expand and customize your base</strong>, unlocking <strong>global upgrades and new gear</strong> for future runs.<br><br><strong>Get ready</strong> for a <strong>space challenge</strong> where <strong>strategy, reflexes, and risk management</strong> are key to becoming the <strong>galaxy\u2019s most notorious smuggler</strong>.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/extras/gif6.gif?t=1747229013\" />","developers":["Moon Mind Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292110/e7e375cc34d4355c524fbe3b4500c99e34602326/header.jpg?t=1747229013","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Moon Mind Studio all rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257136151,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136151/movie480.mp4?t=1746728250","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136151/movie_max.mp4?t=1746728250"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a